WEBVTT

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:05.952
Revenue Overview shows your open pipeline, what’s late, and how closed deals went.

00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:07.668
Pick a view and a period.

00:00:07.668 --> 00:00:11.828
Views follow your organization’s reporting lines and access.

00:00:12.234 --> 00:00:16.242
Pipeline is the value of your open deals today, not booked value.

00:00:16.242 --> 00:00:19.752
Booked value and win rate cover the period you picked.

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:23.950
“Closed-deal flow” shows won and lost deals by month.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:28.250
To act on what’s late, choose “Review” on the past-due card.
